            "param": {
                "system": "You are an expert HR recruiter. Your task is to analyze resumes, classify them, and evaluate their quality.",
                "user": "Analyze the following resume content.\n1. Classify it into exactly one of these categories: 'ACCOUNTANT', 'ARTS', 'SALES', 'TEACHER'.\n2. Assign a suitability score from 0 to 100 based on qualifications and clarity.\n3. Provide a brief reason for your score and classification.\n\nResume Content:\n{{#'2-2'.text#}}\n\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object with the following keys: \"category\", \"score\" (number), \"reason\".\nExample: {\"category\": \"ARTS\", \"score\": 85, \"reason\": \"Strong portfolio described...\"}"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "2-4",
            "type": "code",
            "param": {
                "variables": [
                    [
                        "file_obj",
